  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Choose one class of <strong>Ki Technique</strong>: <em>Beam, Blast, Barrage</em>, or <em>Omni</em>. You gain +1 to <em>Static Bonus</em> when using this type of <strong>Ki Technique</strong>. At <strong>Level 7</strong> this becomes +2 and at <strong>Level 13</strong> you get to pick a second type of <strong>Ki Technique</strong> to gain this bonus.</p>\n<p>At <strong>Level 18</strong> you get an +1 <em>Static Bonus</em> that you can place on any class of <strong>Ki Technique</strong>, regardless of if you choose that category previously.</p>\n",
